  "description": "Shop 24 Christmas Vertical Stripe Overlays in watercolor red, green, cream, and blush tones for festive gift wrap, holiday cards, packaging, and seasonal designs.\nCreate festive seasonal designs with these Christmas Vertical Stripe Overlays. This collection features 24 watercolor-inspired vertical stripe patterns in classic Christmas red, evergreen, cream, blush pink, and warm neutral shades. The designs include fine pinstripes, bold alternating bands, irregular hand-painted brushstrokes, and varied stripe widths for a natural, artistic finish.\nPerfect for designers, small business owners, and holiday craft creators, these Christmas stripe patterns bring a coordinated seasonal look to gift packaging, greeting cards, invitations, stationery, product labels, and festive branding. Use the different stripe styles to create everything from traditional Christmas projects to soft, modern holiday designs.\n🎯 Included\n✔️ 24 unique vertical stripe designs\n✔️ High-quality PNG files\n✔️ Transparent background overlays\n✔️ Watercolor-inspired Christmas stripe patterns\n✔️ Red, green, cream, blush pink, and neutral color variations\nAI precision, human touch. Quality and inspiration on every design.\n🎯 Perfect For\n✔️ Christmas gift wrap and gift box designs\n✔️ Holiday greeting cards and invitations\n✔️ Festive journals and notebook covers\n✔️ Christmas product packaging and labels\n✔️ Gift tags and seasonal stationery\n✔️ Small business holiday branding\n✔️ Holiday party printables\n✔️ Sublimation and print-on-demand projects\nThank You For Stopping By My Store.\nFollow me to be the first to know about upcoming promotions, new arrivals, freebies, and more!\nIf you have a moment, please take a minute to rate and review my product. It Will Be Very Appreciated.\nEnjoy ^_^",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Shop 24 Christmas Vertical Stripe Overlays in watercolor red, green, cream, and blush tones for festive gift wrap, holiday cards, packaging, and seasonal designs.</p>\n<p>Create festive seasonal designs with these Christmas Vertical Stripe Overlays. This collection features 24 watercolor-inspired vertical stripe patterns in classic Christmas red, evergreen, cream, blush pink, and warm neutral shades. The designs include fine pinstripes, bold alternating bands, irregular hand-painted brushstrokes, and varied stripe widths for a natural, artistic finish.</p>\n<p>Perfect for designers, small business owners, and holiday craft creators, these Christmas stripe patterns bring a coordinated seasonal look to gift packaging, greeting cards, invitations, stationery, product labels, and festive branding. Use the different stripe styles to create everything from traditional Christmas projects to soft, modern holiday designs.</p>\n<p>🎯 Included</p>\n<p>✔️ 24 unique vertical stripe designs<br>\n✔️ High-quality PNG files<br>\n✔️ Transparent background overlays<br>\n✔️ Watercolor-inspired Christmas stripe patterns<br>\n✔️ Red, green, cream, blush pink, and neutral color variations</p>\n<p>AI precision, human touch. Quality and inspiration on every design.</p>\n<p>🎯 Perfect For</p>\n<p>✔️ Christmas gift wrap and gift box designs<br>\n✔️ Holiday greeting cards and invitations<br>\n✔️ Festive journals and notebook covers<br>\n✔️ Christmas product packaging and labels<br>\n✔️ Gift tags and seasonal stationery<br>\n✔️ Small business holiday branding<br>\n✔️ Holiday party printables<br>\n✔️ Sublimation and print-on-demand projects</p>\n<p>Thank You For Stopping By My Store.</p>\n<p>Follow me to be the first to know about upcoming promotions, new arrivals, freebies, and more!<br>\nIf you have a moment, please take a minute to rate and review my product. It Will Be Very Appreciated.</p>\n<p>Enjoy ^_^</p>",
